source, so the element names inside <IPv4Parameters> are unknown. Writing
a guess would produce a rule the switch accepts and never matches, which is
worse than not offering it. The ACL view says so if you select one.

LLDP NEIGHBOURS. There is no neighbour table. LLDP can be turned on and
timed, and CDP can be turned on, but this firmware exposes nothing that
